---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout lang="en" title="Privacy Policy, Laps" description="Laps collects no data. Your books and reading stay on your iPhone." page="privacy">
  <article class="doc">
    <p class="kicker">Laps</p>
    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="updated">Last updated: October 9, 2026</p>
    <p class="lead">Laps does not collect, store on any server, share or sell any personal data.</p>
    <div class="box">
      <dl>
        <dt>Everything stays on your iPhone</dt>
        <dd>Your books, reading records, exams, memos and settings are saved only on your device. The widgets read the same data on the same device. Laps has no account, no server and no analytics.</dd>
        <dt>Notifications</dt>
        <dd>Daily reminders are scheduled on your device. Laps does not use push notifications.</dd>
        <dt>Purchases</dt>
        <dd>The Lifetime Pass is sold by Apple through the App Store. Laps only learns from Apple whether the pass is active; it never sees your payment details.</dd>
        <dt>Email</dt>
        <dd>If you write to us, we receive your message only because you chose to send it, and use it only to answer you.</dd>
        <dt>Deleting the app</dt>
        <dd>Deleting Laps deletes all of its data.</dd>
      </dl>
    </div>
    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p><a class="link" href="mailto:laps@wlswo.me">laps@wlswo.me</a></p>
  </article>
</Layout>
